    },
    "%lld%% of adapter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "占适配器 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "°C" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "46+" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "46+"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A charge session survives the app being backgrounded: it ends when you unplug, not when you switch away. Any stretch the app missed is left out of the totals rather than estimated, and the session says how much of itself was actually measured." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切到后台不会结束一次充电记录：记录在拔掉充电器时才结束，而不是在你切走时。应用没看到的那段时间会从总量中排除，而不是估算补上；每条记录都会注明其中有多少是真正测到的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Above 80% the charger tapers to constant-voltage, so low draw here is normal battery chemistry, not a weak charger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超过 80% 后充电转入恒压涓流阶段，此时功率偏低是正常的电池特性，不是充电器不行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessories" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessory battery levels aren't available on this version of iOS." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 iOS 版本不支持读取配件电量。"
