    "MiniWatts Pro" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MiniWatts Pro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MiniWatts Pro reads the phone's own power management sensors through private frameworks — IOKit, IOHIDEventSystemClient and BatteryCenter. Analysis stays on this device; reports leave only when you choose to share them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MiniWatts Pro 通过私有框架 IOKit、IOHIDEventSystemClient 和 BatteryCenter 读取手机自身的电源管理传感器。分析在本设备上完成；仅在你主动分享时导出报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MiniWatts Pro reads the phone's own power management sensors through private frameworks — IOKit, IOHIDEventSystemClient and BatteryCenter. Nothing leaves the device and nothing is written outside the app's own container." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MiniWatts Pro 通过私有框架 IOKit、IOHIDEventSystemClient 和 BatteryCenter 读取手机自身的电源管理传感器。分析在本设备上完成；仅在你主动分享时导出报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
