        }
      }
    },
    "Only complete observed ranges with at least 90% coverage are ranked. Wired and wireless are compared separately." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅完整观测且覆盖率至少 90% 的区间参与排名。有线与无线分别比较。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overview" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "总览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power (W) — input / battery" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "功率（W）— 输入／电池"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puts the reading in a floating window that stays on top of other apps and keeps updating once a second. It is the only place iOS lets an app keep a number moving while it is off screen: a widget is refreshed a few times an hour, and the Lock Screen activity only moves while MiniWatts Pro itself is running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把读数放进一个悬浮窗，它浮在其他 App 上方，每秒更新一次。这是 iOS 唯一允许 App 在离开屏幕后还能让数字继续走动的地方：小组件每小时只刷新几次，锁屏实时活动也只在 MiniWatts Pro 自己运行时才会变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recent trend + historical segments; some portions may be extrapolated." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次趋势与历史分段相结合；部分区间可能使用外推。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recent trend only — rough estimate; charging may slow near full." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅依据本次趋势粗略估算；接近满电时可能减速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recording was interrupted. The end is the last observed time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录曾中断，结束时间为最后实际观测时刻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sensors can only be read while MiniWatts Pro is on screen, so a charge is only recorded for as long as the phone stays awake. With this on, the screen is held on — but only while a charger is connected, never on battery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有 MiniWatts Pro 在前台时才能读取传感器，所以一次充电只能记录到屏幕保持点亮为止。打开后会保持屏幕常亮——但仅限连接充电器时，用电池时绝不会。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sessions" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充电记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows charge power on the Lock Screen, in the Dynamic Island and in StandBy. It updates only while MiniWatts Pro is running; once the app is suspended the reading is marked as paused rather than shown as current." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在锁定屏幕、灵动岛和待机显示中显示充电功率。它只在 MiniWatts Pro 运行时更新；App 被挂起后，读数会标记为已暂停，而不会被当作当前数值显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System thermal pressure" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统热压力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System version" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Target" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目标电量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Target %lld%%" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目标 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Target reached" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已达到目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The activity starts while a charger is connected and MiniWatts Pro is in front, refreshes while MiniWatts Pro runs, and marks the reading paused once the app is suspended. Unplug with MiniWatts Pro running and it ends two minutes later; unplug while it is suspended and it stays until MiniWatts Pro runs again. Tap End on the activity to close it at any time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接充电器且 MiniWatts Pro 位于前台时会启动实时活动，并在 MiniWatts Pro 运行期间持续刷新；App 被暂停后，读数会标记为已暂停。在 MiniWatts Pro 运行时拔下充电器，两分钟后自动结束；如果拔下时 App 已被暂停，它会一直保留，直到 MiniWatts Pro 再次运行。随时可以点实时活动上的“结束”把它关掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current charge is kept. This cannot be undone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留正在记录的充电。删除无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This record remains active during history cleanup." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清理历史时，此次充电会继续记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To %lld%%" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "到 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To date" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结束日期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unsupported history format" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不支持的历史格式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "视图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the window is open MiniWatts Pro keeps running, so it also records the charge with the screen locked — and it draws more power than being suspended. Close the window when you are done with it. No sound is ever played; the window uses the same system feature as a video playing in the corner, which is why the app declares audio playback at all." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "悬浮窗开着时 MiniWatts Pro 会一直运行，所以锁屏后也能继续记录这次充电，同时也比挂起时更耗电，用完请关掉它。它不会播放任何声音：悬浮窗用的是和角落里播放视频相同的系统功能，App 声明音频播放能力只是为了它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Widgets read the sensors themselves whenever iOS refreshes them — usually every 15 to 60 minutes — and straight away when you plug in or unplug with MiniWatts Pro open. Each one says when its numbers were taken." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小组件会在 iOS 刷新时自行读取传感器——通常每 15 到 60 分钟一次；MiniWatts Pro 打开时插拔充电器会立即刷新。每个小组件都会注明数据的读取时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wired comparison" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有线充电比较"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless comparison" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电比较"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS will not open the window yet. Leave MiniWatts Pro on screen for a moment and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 现在还不让打开这个窗口。让 MiniWatts Pro 在屏幕上多停一会儿，再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No records to export" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有可导出的记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Targets are used for estimates only. Remaining time uses observed percentage trends and comparable history; it is not a charging limit or a guaranteed completion time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目标仅用于预测。剩余时间根据已观测电量趋势与可比历史估算，不能设置充电上限，也不保证实际完成时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analysis stays on this device; reports leave only when you choose to share them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "分析在本设备上完成；仅在你主动分享时导出报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retry" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Average in / cell" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
