    "The share of measured input reaching the cell. Phone load and conversion loss affect this ratio." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实测输入到达电芯的比例，受手机自身用电和转换损耗影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For live readings over other apps, open the floating meter. Without it, background monitoring pauses; reopen MiniWatts Pro to resume." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要在其他应用上方持续更新时，请开启浮窗。未开启浮窗时，后台监测会暂停；重新打开 MiniWatts Pro 即可恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Observed %lld of 2 charge-level increases" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已观察到 %lld／2 次电量上升"
