        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the app open or use the floating meter until the level rises twice. Background gaps restart the trend. Historical estimates need at least 3 comparable completed records for each segment." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请保持应用在前台或使用浮窗，直到观察到两次电量上升。后台观测缺口会重建趋势；历史预测的每个分段需要至少 3 次可比的已结束记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the app open or use the floating meter to rebuild a continuous charge trend." : {
