    "Used for the %-rate power readout and, when selected, the power-based charge forecast. Automatic prediction uses reported capacity or the verified iPhone 17 rating with measured cell voltage. The untouched 15 Wh default is not treated as measured capacity." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Used for the %-rate power readout and, when selected, the power-based charge forecast. Automatic prediction uses reported capacity or the verified iPhone 17 rating with measured cell voltage. The untouched 15 Wh default is not treated as measured capacity."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于电量变化推算的功率，并可选择用于功率充电预测。自动预测使用系统报告的容量或已核实的 iPhone 17 标称容量，结合实测电芯电压。未经确认的默认 15 Wh 不会被当作实测容量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
